(3305264, 461093, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and intenet here. I think you have a good making for a spectacular photo. The line is good. Would be interesting to see if the climber was halway up with hime being in focus... Just a thought. Still colors and nice and it is a well thoughtout idea.</td>', 'I like the idea and intenet here. I think you have a good making for a spectacular photo. The line is good. Would be interesting to see if the climber was halway up with hime being in focus... Just a thought. Still colors and nice and it is a well thoughtout idea.', '2007-01-31 00:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3305266, 460789, 66515, '<td valign="top">The effect that is looked for in this challenge is good but the subject itself is really kinda blah.</td>', 'The effect that is looked for in this challenge is good but the subject itself is really kinda blah.', '2007-01-31 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
