(3305337, 460385, 29011, '<td valign="top">The colors , composition and lighting...A very nice still life capture. But I must say for this challenge I''m looking for something more than just an OOF background, it seems almost featureless. Perhaps if there was something OOF in the background I could relate to. In any case, this is a very pleasing shot to look at :)</td>', 'The colors , composition and lighting...A very nice still life capture. But I must say for this challenge I''m looking for something more than just an OOF background, it seems almost featureless. Perhaps if there was something OOF in the background I could relate to. In any case, this is a very pleasing shot to look at :)', '2007-01-31 00:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3305342, 459990, 62727, '<td valign="top">Love it! 10</td>', 'Love it! 10', '2007-01-31 00:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
