(3305406, 460572, 54540, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro!  I wish there were more background and foreground to demonstrate the shallow DOF challenge though.  Still, a really good macro!  Well done.</td>', 'Fantastic macro!  I wish there were more background and foreground to demonstrate the shallow DOF challenge though.  Still, a really good macro!  Well done.', '2007-01-31 00:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3305408, 459572, 62727, '<td valign="top">Wow! 10</td>', 'Wow! 10', '2007-01-31 00:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3305416, 458649, 29011, '<td valign="top">A very nice looking b/w shot. Only nitpick is that the beans look too black, almost as if they''re not there and it''s one big black mass. I see some detail in the front beans, just would''ve liked to see a bit more. Some playing with Curves or Shadows/Higlights in Photoshop could''ve helped bring out more of the detail in the shadows. Not too much, just a bit so as not to make the image look too busy.</td>', 'A very nice looking b/w shot. Only nitpick is that the beans look too black, almost as if they''re not there and it''s one big black mass. I see some detail in the front beans, just would''ve liked to see a bit more. Some playing with Curves or Shadows/Higlights in Photoshop could''ve helped bring out more of the detail in the shadows. Not too much, just a bit so as not to make the image look too busy.', '2007-01-31 00:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3305420, 459043, 62727, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I love the colors! 10</td>', 'Great job!  I love the colors! 10', '2007-01-31 00:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
