(3305457, 458105, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Not full aperture, but just right for this situation.  I love how strings always look so wide going to narrow going to wide in these situations.    I like how the silver metal turns to blue in the out of focus areas.  I like the dust, makes it look real.</td>', 'Nice.  Not full aperture, but just right for this situation.  I love how strings always look so wide going to narrow going to wide in these situations.    I like how the silver metal turns to blue in the out of focus areas.  I like the dust, makes it look real.', '2007-01-31 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
