(3308182, 460901, 68256, '<td valign="top">The willows are a little distracting to me, and don''t enhance the subject.  That is of course just my opinion.  Also, I think a less centered composition would have worked better.  It would have been so cool if you could have captured the goldeney in a larger "window" so that he would have been framed by the oof willows.  Again, just mho and it is a great capture.</td>', 'The willows are a little distracting to me, and don''t enhance the subject.  That is of course just my opinion.  Also, I think a less centered composition would have worked better.  It would have been so cool if you could have captured the goldeney in a larger "window" so that he would have been framed by the oof willows.  Again, just mho and it is a great capture.', '2007-01-31 12:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
