(3311689, 460635, 57378, '<td valign="top">Very nice - Could have been a much stronger image in my mind with 2 things changed. <br/>1. Background would have been better if it was darker - That way the single stem would have stood out more - As it is it blends into one of the white items in the background.<br/>2. The twig on the left is just a little too distracting and sharp enough to take away focus from the very sharp one. Nice picture.</td>', 'Very nice - Could have been a much stronger image in my mind with 2 things changed. 1. Background would have been better if it was darker - That way the single stem would have stood out more - As it is it blends into one of the white items in the background.2. The twig on the left is just a little too distracting and sharp enough to take away focus from the very sharp one. Nice picture.', '2007-02-01 04:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3311694, 460658, 57378, '<td valign="top">You nailed it - Great challenge entry - Tells a lot about the situation and subject. If there is one nit pick it''s the bright white mark in the lower left corner. Still a 10 from me - Nice.</td>', 'You nailed it - Great challenge entry - Tells a lot about the situation and subject. If there is one nit pick it''s the bright white mark in the lower left corner. Still a 10 from me - Nice.', '2007-02-01 04:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
