(3314010, 461023, 34938, '<td valign="top">great detail, but the guy in the bg is distracting and the arm is cut off...I would have gooten in closer and really picked up some of those lines on the face, then you would have shallower dof...I like the duotone</td>', 'great detail, but the guy in the bg is distracting and the arm is cut off...I would have gooten in closer and really picked up some of those lines on the face, then you would have shallower dof...I like the duotone', '2007-02-01 15:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314023, 461544, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely tones...great image...light is a little flat</td>', 'lovely tones...great image...light is a little flat', '2007-02-01 15:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314029, 461573, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow, what is this? amazing image...a great abstract...awesome. Not sure it would be an image I would use to convey shallow dof, but it works as an image for me</td>', 'wow, what is this? amazing image...a great abstract...awesome. Not sure it would be an image I would use to convey shallow dof, but it works as an image for me', '2007-02-01 15:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
