(3314041, 459572, 34938, '<td valign="top">It''s a great image, but not one that really shows off shallow dow...there is nice dof, but not shallow dof...nonetheless, awesome light and colour 8</td>', 'It''s a great image, but not one that really shows off shallow dow...there is nice dof, but not shallow dof...nonetheless, awesome light and colour 8', '2007-02-01 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314043, 461279, 34938, '<td valign="top">a lovely b and w study...the frame is nice</td>', 'a lovely b and w study...the frame is nice', '2007-02-01 15:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314065, 461153, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this phto. Great captured moment. The depth is nice too. One main negative is the head chopping in the background people. It kind of takes away from the moment. The rest is great. Terrific colors, nice sharpness, well composed (except those background heads). Above average rating from me.</td>', 'I like the idea of this phto. Great captured moment. The depth is nice too. One main negative is the head chopping in the background people. It kind of takes away from the moment. The rest is great. Terrific colors, nice sharpness, well composed (except those background heads). Above average rating from me.', '2007-02-01 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314181, 461348, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely, delicate, special...love this...frame is great</td>', 'lovely, delicate, special...love this...frame is great', '2007-02-01 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314207, 461326, 34938, '<td valign="top">this is superb...it has to be a ribbon winner for it has all the qualities of great photography: composition, dof, subject matter, light, editing and the list goes on...perfect and faultless to me 10</td>', 'this is superb...it has to be a ribbon winner for it has all the qualities of great photography: composition, dof, subject matter, light, editing and the list goes on...perfect and faultless to me 10', '2007-02-01 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314213, 461255, 7743, '<td valign="top">Super narrow DOF that works.</td>', 'Super narrow DOF that works.', '2007-02-01 16:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314214, 461283, 34938, '<td valign="top">well done...a great stock image...quirky, well execited</td>', 'well done...a great stock image...quirky, well execited', '2007-02-01 16:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314219, 460712, 34938, '<td valign="top">cute...I would have cropped out the left and right space as the ground is distracting...a square crop would have been powerful and the image would have been great, but maybe not for a shallow dof challenge 7</td>', 'cute...I would have cropped out the left and right space as the ground is distracting...a square crop would have been powerful and the image would have been great, but maybe not for a shallow dof challenge 7', '2007-02-01 16:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314284, 460817, 42181, '<td valign="top">IMO the background is a little distracting, although the DOF is good.</td>', 'IMO the background is a little distracting, although the DOF is good.', '2007-02-01 16:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314290, 461558, 7743, '<td valign="top">The chosen forground object works well here though I''d like it to be a bit sharper.  The choice of DOF is perfect though and the OOF background object mimics the foreground object a bit.</td>', 'The chosen forground object works well here though I''d like it to be a bit sharper.  The choice of DOF is perfect though and the OOF background object mimics the foreground object a bit.', '2007-02-01 16:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314298, 461119, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great timing, great capture, great DOF.</td>', 'Great timing, great capture, great DOF.', '2007-02-01 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314307, 461357, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good sense of winter comes from this scene.  I like the choice of DOF however the main subject is a bit too central for me.  A little lower and to the left I think would work much better.  By getting a higher angle on the shot would get more separation between the in focus object and the OOF background object.</td>', 'Good sense of winter comes from this scene.  I like the choice of DOF however the main subject is a bit too central for me.  A little lower and to the left I think would work much better.  By getting a higher angle on the shot would get more separation between the in focus object and the OOF background object.', '2007-02-01 16:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314311, 461105, 72274, '<td valign="top">That''s not really Shallow Depth of Field.. more motion panning than anything.. great photo though.</td>', 'That''s not really Shallow Depth of Field.. more motion panning than anything.. great photo though.', '2007-02-01 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314316, 460952, 72274, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Perfect image for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Perfect image for this challenge.', '2007-02-01 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314333, 459408, 42181, '<td valign="top">OK what lens on earth did you use to get a focus of just 1 mm, superb.</td>', 'OK what lens on earth did you use to get a focus of just 1 mm, superb.', '2007-02-01 16:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314384, 460572, 55956, '<td valign="top">can be a nice shot but the colours of the bee are too much red. good the details on the foreground.</td>', 'can be a nice shot but the colours of the bee are too much red. good the details on the foreground.', '2007-02-01 16:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314409, 459388, 31443, '<td valign="top">Total relaxation and no worries, what a blessed little one.</td>', 'Total relaxation and no worries, what a blessed little one.', '2007-02-01 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314447, 461551, 55956, '<td valign="top">very good. I like it.</td>', 'very good. I like it.', '2007-02-01 17:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314453, 461424, 51146, '<td valign="top">Nice fish! great color</td>', 'Nice fish! great color', '2007-02-01 17:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314467, 461328, 51146, '<td valign="top">Meaow</td>', 'Meaow', '2007-02-01 17:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314492, 458993, 55956, '<td valign="top">i like the idea</td>', 'i like the idea', '2007-02-01 17:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314554, 461283, 55956, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2007-02-01 17:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314576, 461413, 55956, '<td valign="top">great image.</td>', 'great image.', '2007-02-01 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314584, 458518, 62318, '<td valign="top">The idea here is good. The lighting is nice. Not sure if I like how the composition is centered. I think more of a traditiona 4x6 or even 5x7 format would have helped (I almost didn''t notice the snake at first). Background is nice. You''ll probably get hit a bit from the noise police. I think a tighter crop would have made this a real winner. Above average rating from me.</td>', 'The idea here is good. The lighting is nice. Not sure if I like how the composition is centered. I think more of a traditiona 4x6 or even 5x7 format would have helped (I almost didn''t notice the snake at first). Background is nice. You''ll probably get hit a bit from the noise police. I think a tighter crop would have made this a real winner. Above average rating from me.', '2007-02-01 17:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315050, 461022, 67883, '<td valign="top">The 144 thousand shall be the ones to know that song. :) I think the DoF could be better also the edges are distracting.</td>', 'The 144 thousand shall be the ones to know that song. :) I think the DoF could be better also the edges are distracting.', '2007-02-01 19:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315053, 461622, 67883, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t show much, even if it is a macro. The DoF is nice though.</td>', 'This picture doesn''t show much, even if it is a macro. The DoF is nice though.', '2007-02-01 19:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315062, 459339, 67883, '<td valign="top">Are you sure you didn''t just take a picture of the backside. ;) Its ok, but the overexposed background is not nice.</td>', 'Are you sure you didn''t just take a picture of the backside. ;) Its ok, but the overexposed background is not nice.', '2007-02-01 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315068, 459186, 67883, '<td valign="top">Wow... great colors and fantastic image.</td>', 'Wow... great colors and fantastic image.', '2007-02-01 19:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315133, 460569, 45475, '<td valign="top">How delightful! Years ago, there was a tv ad for a brand of australian bottled water depicting two snails in the ''throws of passion'', much like this. Fantastic ad, will never forget it. Haven''t drunk that water since though LOL! Nice capture, well done :)</td>', 'How delightful! Years ago, there was a tv ad for a brand of australian bottled water depicting two snails in the ''throws of passion'', much like this. Fantastic ad, will never forget it. Haven''t drunk that water since though LOL! Nice capture, well done :)', '2007-02-01 19:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315151, 461569, 62164, '<td valign="top">maybe a little better light</td>', 'maybe a little better light', '2007-02-01 19:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315169, 458717, 57831, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=458717#<br/> 4  cast your vote...</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=458717# 4  cast your vote...', '2007-02-01 19:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315217, 461623, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the razor thin DOF and the droplets are quite sharp.  However, my eye is drawn to the top of the stamen.  I wonder if the image would be better with just a little more DOF so that part is more in focus.</td>', 'I like the razor thin DOF and the droplets are quite sharp.  However, my eye is drawn to the top of the stamen.  I wonder if the image would be better with just a little more DOF so that part is more in focus.', '2007-02-01 19:49:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3315236, 458189, 7743, '<td valign="top">Is that a strawberry and a grape? Not that it matters.  <br/> <br/>The DOF is shallow and the rule of thirds is being employed however the lighting is a bit flat.  Also the focus on the grape(?) seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Is that a strawberry and a grape? Not that it matters.   The DOF is shallow and the rule of thirds is being employed however the lighting is a bit flat.  Also the focus on the grape(?) seems a bit soft.', '2007-02-01 19:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315354, 460533, 35947, '<td valign="top">Aawwwww!  Such a cutie!  A little more depth of field would help IMHO for the challenge voters.  But I can''t give less than a 10 to Dobe!  Hope to see more of your friend after the challenge and in other challenges so everyone doesn''t think all Dobe shots are mine!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Aawwwww!  Such a cutie!  A little more depth of field would help IMHO for the challenge voters.  But I can''t give less than a 10 to Dobe!  Hope to see more of your friend after the challenge and in other challenges so everyone doesn''t think all Dobe shots are mine!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-02-01 20:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315356, 461326, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach.  Even though the egret is centered the image is quite dynamic due to the angle of the branch and the stance of the bird.  I''m not sure if I like the blown out background but maybe if the bird stood out more the background would fit in better.</td>', 'Interesting approach.  Even though the egret is centered the image is quite dynamic due to the angle of the branch and the stance of the bird.  I''m not sure if I like the blown out background but maybe if the bird stood out more the background would fit in better.', '2007-02-01 20:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315367, 459813, 7743, '<td valign="top">Very sharp on the boy''s face and the DOF is just deep enough so his head doesn''t look like it''s floating in the frame.</td>', 'Very sharp on the boy''s face and the DOF is just deep enough so his head doesn''t look like it''s floating in the frame.', '2007-02-01 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315372, 460393, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like these glimpses into the centre of flowers.  The DOF is just right, showing detail in the middle and slowing softening as it reaches to the outer petals.</td>', 'I like these glimpses into the centre of flowers.  The DOF is just right, showing detail in the middle and slowing softening as it reaches to the outer petals.', '2007-02-01 20:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315387, 457808, 35947, '<td valign="top">This was done in basic editing!  Wow!  Can''t wait to see how you put this together!</td>', 'This was done in basic editing!  Wow!  Can''t wait to see how you put this together!', '2007-02-01 20:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315390, 461480, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like these type of shots.  Even though the bloke in the background is OOF he is engaging the photographer.  The foreground fellow is nice and sharp.  As far as placement in the frame I think the space on the left puts the image a little off balance.  Cropping to a square I think would work well here.</td>', 'I like these type of shots.  Even though the bloke in the background is OOF he is engaging the photographer.  The foreground fellow is nice and sharp.  As far as placement in the frame I think the space on the left puts the image a little off balance.  Cropping to a square I think would work well here.', '2007-02-01 20:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315409, 460519, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the nostalgic feel of the image however feel the DOF chosen is a little too shallow.  I think having the entire cup/saucer (at least the parts visible to the camera) in focus.  Having a slightly deeper DOF would give definition to the background to show context and provide a bit more of a story.</td>', 'I like the nostalgic feel of the image however feel the DOF chosen is a little too shallow.  I think having the entire cup/saucer (at least the parts visible to the camera) in focus.  Having a slightly deeper DOF would give definition to the background to show context and provide a bit more of a story.', '2007-02-01 20:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315431, 459616, 70738, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the challenge for its simplicity.  Did you try taking the picture with the far "A" in focus?  I feel like the framing draws the eye in that direction, and having the far point in focus could work even better.</td>', 'I like this take on the challenge for its simplicity.  Did you try taking the picture with the far "A" in focus?  I feel like the framing draws the eye in that direction, and having the far point in focus could work even better.', '2007-02-01 20:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315479, 459794, 70738, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge!</td>', 'Great take on the challenge!', '2007-02-01 20:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315496, 458099, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wow...love the "hair" on the leaf too!  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow...love the "hair" on the leaf too!  Great shot!', '2007-02-01 20:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315503, 459387, 70514, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me.</td>', 'Too dark for me.', '2007-02-01 20:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315506, 460802, 70738, '<td valign="top">Neat picture - gets an 8 from me.  with a more selective crop to take off the blank white space at the top, would have been even higher, as it''s just a bit too bright up there for my taste.</td>', 'Neat picture - gets an 8 from me.  with a more selective crop to take off the blank white space at the top, would have been even higher, as it''s just a bit too bright up there for my taste.', '2007-02-01 20:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315507, 458357, 70514, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Love it!</td>', 'Funny!  Love it!', '2007-02-01 20:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315511, 461496, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2007-02-01 20:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315535, 461154, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love what you are trying to do here, however, the whole photo just looks white. It doesn''t seem to have a very definite focus.</td>', 'I love what you are trying to do here, however, the whole photo just looks white. It doesn''t seem to have a very definite focus.', '2007-02-01 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315537, 461664, 70738, '<td valign="top">Neat!  What''s the blue in the background from?</td>', 'Neat!  What''s the blue in the background from?', '2007-02-01 20:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315631, 460433, 69487, '<td valign="top">I don''t</td>', 'I don''t', '2007-02-01 21:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315722, 461298, 7743, '<td valign="top">The bird really pops with the choice of DOF though the sparkle in the eye seems to be missing.  The diagonal makes the image dynamic though I feel the angle is a little too acute.  Also, I would like to see more to give the image context.  As it is, the bird is floating with no connection to it''s environment.</td>', 'The bird really pops with the choice of DOF though the sparkle in the eye seems to be missing.  The diagonal makes the image dynamic though I feel the angle is a little too acute.  Also, I would like to see more to give the image context.  As it is, the bird is floating with no connection to it''s environment.', '2007-02-01 21:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315775, 459794, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=2 <br/>comments: Absolutly stunning!  Well done.  Love the colors and the way the flowers angle draws your eyes up to the water drops.  <br/> <br/>Hope to see this with a blue ribbon under it very soon.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=2 comments: Absolutly stunning!  Well done.  Love the colors and the way the flowers angle draws your eyes up to the water drops.   Hope to see this with a blue ribbon under it very soon.', '2007-02-01 21:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315828, 457881, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot though I don''t get your title.  I like bokeh generated by the shallow DOF however I don''t feel a connection between what''s in focus and the rest of the image.</td>', 'Interesting shot though I don''t get your title.  I like bokeh generated by the shallow DOF however I don''t feel a connection between what''s in focus and the rest of the image.', '2007-02-01 21:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315837, 461460, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: Nice, good idea and execution.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1 comments: Nice, good idea and execution.', '2007-02-01 21:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315838, 459106, 7743, '<td valign="top">Diagonals can make for more dynamic images however in this case I feel the angle is too acute.  Also, the focus doesn''t seem to be on one column of keys.  It feels a bit random.  I think using a slightly larger DOF would help there.</td>', 'Diagonals can make for more dynamic images however in this case I feel the angle is too acute.  Also, the focus doesn''t seem to be on one column of keys.  It feels a bit random.  I think using a slightly larger DOF would help there.', '2007-02-01 21:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315945, 457870, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=2 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: I like this.  At first I thought the blurred part was just it''s shadow but then realized it wasn''t.  Very nicely done.  This is one of few I have seen that truly have gone shallow.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=2 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=1 comments: I like this.  At first I thought the blurred part was just it''s shadow but then realized it wasn''t.  Very nicely done.  This is one of few I have seen that truly have gone shallow.  Good luck.', '2007-02-01 22:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315961, 459903, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: Nice job at getting up close and personal.  I love the small amount of red that helps draw your attention through the image.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=1 comments: Nice job at getting up close and personal.  I love the small amount of red that helps draw your attention through the image.', '2007-02-01 22:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315968, 460347, 7743, '<td valign="top">With playing cards, razor thin DOF still produces a sharply focused subject.  On the downside, using the shallowist DOF possible can produce an image where the subject is disconnected from the rest of the image.  This I feel is what is happening here.  I think having the fingers more in focus would help connect the jack to the rest of the image.</td>', 'With playing cards, razor thin DOF still produces a sharply focused subject.  On the downside, using the shallowist DOF possible can produce an image where the subject is disconnected from the rest of the image.  This I feel is what is happening here.  I think having the fingers more in focus would help connect the jack to the rest of the image.', '2007-02-01 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315996, 460245, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good job getting the image in the left droplet fairly sharp.  The left edge though is a bit soft.  A slightly deeper DOF I think would help there.  Also, putting the branch on a diagonal rather than straight across would make the image more dynamic.</td>', 'Good job getting the image in the left droplet fairly sharp.  The left edge though is a bit soft.  A slightly deeper DOF I think would help there.  Also, putting the branch on a diagonal rather than straight across would make the image more dynamic.', '2007-02-01 22:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3316005, 460610, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and I like the glow from the light though feel it needs to be softened a bit to prevent the harshness of the light on her face.</td>', 'Nice expression and I like the glow from the light though feel it needs to be softened a bit to prevent the harshness of the light on her face.', '2007-02-01 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3316047, 461458, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: I <b>REALLY</b> like what you have done with this image but I feel it could be a lot more shallow...I know the descriptions don''t state how shallow so I''m not going to mark down on it, I just feel this could be more.  Good luck.<br/> <br/>(edited to add missing word...sorry)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-07 17:38:18.</i></td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=1 comments: I REALLY like what you have done with this image but I feel it could be a lot more shallow...I know the descriptions don''t state how shallow so I''m not going to mark down on it, I just feel this could be more.  Good luck. (edited to add missing word...sorry)', '2007-02-01 22:20:39.000000', '2007-02-07 17:38:18.000000', 1),
(3316049, 461312, 72044, '<td valign="top">wheres the focus here?</td>', 'wheres the focus here?', '2007-02-01 22:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
