(3316265, 460684, 45519, '<td valign="top">Very nice image with a DOF that works well.  Unfortunately, I don''t think it shallow enough to rank it among the elite in this challenge.  If the bulls and Aspen trunks in the background were considerably "blurrier" then it might qualify IMO.  Great image, nice DOF ... just no shallow enough.</td>', 'Very nice image with a DOF that works well.  Unfortunately, I don''t think it shallow enough to rank it among the elite in this challenge.  If the bulls and Aspen trunks in the background were considerably "blurrier" then it might qualify IMO.  Great image, nice DOF ... just no shallow enough.', '2007-02-01 22:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
