(3316281, 459022, 45519, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF at work in this image, but it lacks a focal point IMO.  My eyes wander around aimlessly with no where to stop.</td>', 'Shallow DOF at work in this image, but it lacks a focal point IMO.  My eyes wander around aimlessly with no where to stop.', '2007-02-01 23:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3316303, 457870, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nice example of the challenge theme ... and an elegantly simple image.  That said, the use of shallow DOF doesn''t highlight a subject so much as highlighting use of shallow DOF. ;-)</td>', 'Nice example of the challenge theme ... and an elegantly simple image.  That said, the use of shallow DOF doesn''t highlight a subject so much as highlighting use of shallow DOF. ;-)', '2007-02-01 23:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3316326, 460451, 45519, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF is implied by the blurred sky in the background, but the background blur doesn''t really do a lot to enhance or emphasize the subject as executed here.  The image also suffers from a few technical deficiencies: composition, feet cropped out of frame; color muted and muddy; and overall a tad soft.  Nice attempt though.</td>', 'Shallow DOF is implied by the blurred sky in the background, but the background blur doesn''t really do a lot to enhance or emphasize the subject as executed here.  The image also suffers from a few technical deficiencies: composition, feet cropped out of frame; color muted and muddy; and overall a tad soft.  Nice attempt though.', '2007-02-01 23:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3316348, 458142, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely done ... I like the DOF in this one and the image overall (reflection, touch of color in the background, etc).  If shot again I might angle the syringe so that it "points" more toward the subject (patient) in the background ... further drawing the viewer''s eye to that element of the composition (before the returns naturally to what''s in focus).  Just a thought. :)</td>', 'Nicely done ... I like the DOF in this one and the image overall (reflection, touch of color in the background, etc).  If shot again I might angle the syringe so that it "points" more toward the subject (patient) in the background ... further drawing the viewer''s eye to that element of the composition (before the returns naturally to what''s in focus).  Just a thought. :)', '2007-02-01 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3316355, 460798, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nice winter scene.  I think the DOF works with the composition here, though a touch shallower might make it a stronger contender in *this* particular challenge.</td>', 'Nice winter scene.  I think the DOF works with the composition here, though a touch shallower might make it a stronger contender in *this* particular challenge.', '2007-02-01 23:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
