(3317537, 459248, 66747, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit busy, but it evokes "sharp" memories. And fulfills the challenge. Love the colors, too.</td>', 'A tiny bit busy, but it evokes "sharp" memories. And fulfills the challenge. Love the colors, too.', '2007-02-02 05:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
