(3319211, 459416, 71958, '<td valign="top">One of my 5 favorite in this category.  I think maybe a litte work on the lighting and this would be even better.  Nice work!</td>', 'One of my 5 favorite in this category.  I think maybe a litte work on the lighting and this would be even better.  Nice work!', '2007-02-02 15:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
