(3319218, 461298, 71958, '<td valign="top">One of my 5 favorite in this category.  Don''t know if this was "right place at the right time" or very well planned, but nice work.</td>', 'One of my 5 favorite in this category.  Don''t know if this was "right place at the right time" or very well planned, but nice work.', '2007-02-02 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
