(3319385, 461570, 65319, '<td valign="top">How sweet...little baby feet!  No doubt, when those feet are up and running they''ll keep you busy!  I like the baby''s expression and feeling of warm coziness from this photo.  The composition of horizon looks slightly tilted to me, and the two toes on the far right look ever so slightly out of focus.  Otherwise, a very sweet capture.</td>', 'How sweet...little baby feet!  No doubt, when those feet are up and running they''ll keep you busy!  I like the baby''s expression and feeling of warm coziness from this photo.  The composition of horizon looks slightly tilted to me, and the two toes on the far right look ever so slightly out of focus.  Otherwise, a very sweet capture.', '2007-02-02 16:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3319409, 459794, 65319, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  Stunning!  10.</td>', 'WOW!!!  Stunning!  10.', '2007-02-02 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
