(3320592, 461609, 70771, '<td valign="top">This works well for the challenge, because I can''t really tell what level the rust is on.  Visually, it''s hard to place the depth.  The colors compliment each other nicely.  Well framed, I really like this.</td>', 'This works well for the challenge, because I can''t really tell what level the rust is on.  Visually, it''s hard to place the depth.  The colors compliment each other nicely.  Well framed, I really like this.', '2007-02-02 20:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
