(3320602, 461367, 70771, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the fur on the had and the strands of hair shows how the focus is right on her.  Nice.</td>', 'The sharpness of the fur on the had and the strands of hair shows how the focus is right on her.  Nice.', '2007-02-02 20:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
