(3321040, 460817, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of forground subject however I feel the DOF is too shallow.  As it is the background is just a mix of colour giving no context to your subject.  A little more DOF would give definition to the people (?) and make your image tell more of a story.</td>', 'I like the choice of forground subject however I feel the DOF is too shallow.  As it is the background is just a mix of colour giving no context to your subject.  A little more DOF would give definition to the people (?) and make your image tell more of a story.', '2007-02-02 22:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
