(3321056, 461435, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a still life however the forground subject is too close to the backdrop producing a background that is not quite out of focus enough.  The wrinkles on the backdrop are quite distracting.</td>', 'Good idea for a still life however the forground subject is too close to the backdrop producing a background that is not quite out of focus enough.  The wrinkles on the backdrop are quite distracting.', '2007-02-02 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321058, 460890, 70771, '<td valign="top">Clever, good use of topic!</td>', 'Clever, good use of topic!', '2007-02-02 22:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321061, 460008, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good concept though the dime in focus is too central (for me) and shooting straight into the lines of dimes makes the image quite static.  If the lines of dimes were on the diagonal and the dime in focus were in the upper right corner I think the image would be much more dynamic.</td>', 'Good concept though the dime in focus is too central (for me) and shooting straight into the lines of dimes makes the image quite static.  If the lines of dimes were on the diagonal and the dime in focus were in the upper right corner I think the image would be much more dynamic.', '2007-02-02 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321064, 461625, 7743, '<td valign="top">Now he''s a poser.  The background is blurred just enough to keep the shape but not detract from your subject.  The bright dot just above his right ear is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Now he''s a poser.  The background is blurred just enough to keep the shape but not detract from your subject.  The bright dot just above his right ear is a bit distracting though.', '2007-02-02 22:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321098, 460952, 7743, '<td valign="top">This starling looks cold.  Nice sharp focus however I feel the image could improve with the use of slightly wider DOF, to gain a bit of definition in the background and add context as well as a bit more sparkle in the eye.</td>', 'This starling looks cold.  Nice sharp focus however I feel the image could improve with the use of slightly wider DOF, to gain a bit of definition in the background and add context as well as a bit more sparkle in the eye.', '2007-02-02 22:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321104, 461301, 7743, '<td valign="top">The area of focus is quite sharp though I feel it is too narrow.  Also, by putting this area in the centre makes the image quite static.  If the area of focus were closer to the bottom of the frame (on the third line or below) and slightly to the right the image would be much more dynamic.</td>', 'The area of focus is quite sharp though I feel it is too narrow.  Also, by putting this area in the centre makes the image quite static.  If the area of focus were closer to the bottom of the frame (on the third line or below) and slightly to the right the image would be much more dynamic.', '2007-02-02 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321107, 457888, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good placement for the area in focus however the area of focus is a little too narrow and not the entire number 10 is in focus.</td>', 'Good placement for the area in focus however the area of focus is a little too narrow and not the entire number 10 is in focus.', '2007-02-02 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321119, 461259, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good angle and the width of the DOF seems right for your subject.  However, the left side of the dog is a little dark.</td>', 'Good angle and the width of the DOF seems right for your subject.  However, the left side of the dog is a little dark.', '2007-02-02 23:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
