(3328968, 459337, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: I''m trying to figure out if I''m being to picky on how shallow a DOF should be cause this is about the 3rd out of 7 I''ve voted on that don''t really seem to be fitting the bill.  While looking at past challenges I feel that shallow should be where only a very small portion is in focus (1-2").  I have to say that I wish you were closer to the flowers so that we could tell how shallow the field is.  Still a wonderful image with great colors and layout and even a border that works well with it...good luck.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1 comments: I''m trying to figure out if I''m being to picky on how shallow a DOF should be cause this is about the 3rd out of 7 I''ve voted on that don''t really seem to be fitting the bill.  While looking at past challenges I feel that shallow should be where only a very small portion is in focus (1-2").  I have to say that I wish you were closer to the flowers so that we could tell how shallow the field is.  Still a wonderful image with great colors and layout and even a border that works well with it...good luck.', '2007-02-05 03:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328969, 460682, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/>comments:  I was just looking at a similar image from the first Shallow DOF challenge.  I like this idea and you''ve done well to pull it off but I wish the black item had a bit more familiar shape in the droplets.  It just appears as a blob and doen''t help the image any.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0 comments:  I was just looking at a similar image from the first Shallow DOF challenge.  I like this idea and you''ve done well to pull it off but I wish the black item had a bit more familiar shape in the droplets.  It just appears as a blob and doen''t help the image any.', '2007-02-05 03:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
