(3328972, 460360, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/>comments: I instantly liked this image, maybe it''s cause I''m from the country and have a special liking to images like this, but I feel it isn''t quite a shallow DOF.  Maybe I''m just being too picky.  It seems that if you were closer in on the corn stalks it would portray it better, again I could be wrong, just my opinion.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1 comments: I instantly liked this image, maybe it''s cause I''m from the country and have a special liking to images like this, but I feel it isn''t quite a shallow DOF.  Maybe I''m just being too picky.  It seems that if you were closer in on the corn stalks it would portray it better, again I could be wrong, just my opinion.', '2007-02-05 03:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328976, 461031, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/>comments: I think I would like to see this at a lower angle with more of the ball taking up the frame and just being able to see the dog in the background.  I feel like there is too much extra room for my eyes to roam and get lost, they tend to gravitate to between the ball and dog.  Image also seems very flat to me, might need a contrast boost or something to add some punch to it.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0 comments: I think I would like to see this at a lower angle with more of the ball taking up the frame and just being able to see the dog in the background.  I feel like there is too much extra room for my eyes to roam and get lost, they tend to gravitate to between the ball and dog.  Image also seems very flat to me, might need a contrast boost or something to add some punch to it.', '2007-02-05 03:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
