(3331942, 460171, 69684, '<td valign="top">Too bad the pawn on the right is so sharp.</td>', 'Too bad the pawn on the right is so sharp.', '2007-02-05 17:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3331975, 459915, 42100, '<td valign="top">Usually the razor thin DOF are a bit too harsh and don''t make sense.  But with that leaf staying well within that plane of focus, this one work quite well.  The whole composition is well balanced as a result.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Usually the razor thin DOF are a bit too harsh and don''t make sense.  But with that leaf staying well within that plane of focus, this one work quite well.  The whole composition is well balanced as a result.  Nicely done!', '2007-02-05 17:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332147, 459387, 69684, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty, but perhaps the middle should be sharp.</td>', 'Looks tasty, but perhaps the middle should be sharp.', '2007-02-05 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332202, 460523, 66952, '<td valign="top">Interesting, it almost looks like a studio set. I get absolutely no sence of perspective.</td>', 'Interesting, it almost looks like a studio set. I get absolutely no sence of perspective.', '2007-02-05 18:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332478, 459136, 41800, '<td valign="top">nice idea. you have a very shallow DOF but shooting at this angle the top of the subject is sharp but at the girl''s left side, you start to lose focus. Perhaps a lttle more straight on without the tilt to the right and having the subject in the left third of the photo would add interest.</td>', 'nice idea. you have a very shallow DOF but shooting at this angle the top of the subject is sharp but at the girl''s left side, you start to lose focus. Perhaps a lttle more straight on without the tilt to the right and having the subject in the left third of the photo would add interest.', '2007-02-05 20:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332696, 458476, 40386, '<td valign="top">This would be really lovely if it just had a bit more light which could be achieved by adjusting the levels or curves so as not to blow out the flowers in the rear, increase the saturation a bit and up the contrast very slightly.  Also needs just a bit more sharpening to put the focus on the flower in the front.</td>', 'This would be really lovely if it just had a bit more light which could be achieved by adjusting the levels or curves so as not to blow out the flowers in the rear, increase the saturation a bit and up the contrast very slightly.  Also needs just a bit more sharpening to put the focus on the flower in the front.', '2007-02-05 21:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332702, 461290, 40386, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, I love that the eyes nose and mouth are in focus perfectly.  I am not a big fan of soft focus portraits, also your framing of the subject is great which draws your eyes to his face.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, I love that the eyes nose and mouth are in focus perfectly.  I am not a big fan of soft focus portraits, also your framing of the subject is great which draws your eyes to his face.', '2007-02-05 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332708, 461153, 40386, '<td valign="top">Well what can I say except that this is stunning.  I will be surprised if it isnt in the top 5 at least.  Great framing and composition.</td>', 'Well what can I say except that this is stunning.  I will be surprised if it isnt in the top 5 at least.  Great framing and composition.', '2007-02-05 21:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332711, 461283, 40386, '<td valign="top">Very nice and imaginative, hope it does well for you. 10</td>', 'Very nice and imaginative, hope it does well for you. 10', '2007-02-05 21:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332721, 460436, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and framing.  I like this a lot 10</td>', 'Nice composition and framing.  I like this a lot 10', '2007-02-05 21:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332724, 460403, 40386, '<td valign="top">If this isnt in the top 5 at least then it will be a crime.  Love it. 10</td>', 'If this isnt in the top 5 at least then it will be a crime.  Love it. 10', '2007-02-05 21:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332730, 461480, 40386, '<td valign="top">Wow what a great photo, It just has such a great atmosphere to it, you can almost feel the wind and cold.  I would love to know what the instrument is that he is holding, looks a bit like another version of bagpipes. Good luck 10</td>', 'Wow what a great photo, It just has such a great atmosphere to it, you can almost feel the wind and cold.  I would love to know what the instrument is that he is holding, looks a bit like another version of bagpipes. Good luck 10', '2007-02-05 21:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
