(3335154, 461094, 7743, '<td valign="top">These blossoms are pretty but could use some more light on the in focus ones.  Also, a little more DOF would provide more context in adding detail to the background blossoms.</td>', 'These blossoms are pretty but could use some more light on the in focus ones.  Also, a little more DOF would provide more context in adding detail to the background blossoms.', '2007-02-06 14:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335173, 460993, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I wished there was more room for the bird to peer into...like if the hummingbird was set off to the left of the photo.  Also, I think a little more depth (or at least not front focused quite so much) would have put the entire hummingbird in focus, which I think would have worked better for me.  I realize the challege was shallow DOF and that the hummer''s eye and head are fine so it does work...7</td>', 'Great capture.  I wished there was more room for the bird to peer into...like if the hummingbird was set off to the left of the photo.  Also, I think a little more depth (or at least not front focused quite so much) would have put the entire hummingbird in focus, which I think would have worked better for me.  I realize the challege was shallow DOF and that the hummer''s eye and head are fine so it does work...7', '2007-02-06 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335190, 460880, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to try a shallow dof landscape myself, but never could find an appropriate subject.  Yours works better than any of mine did, but it still leaves me wanting to see that mountain!  Perhaps if the rocks were a little brighter (but then the sky would be blown)...or if there was 1 main thing to focus on like a leaf or flower....+ 2 for your attemp 7 total.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really wanted to try a shallow dof landscape myself, but never could find an appropriate subject.  Yours works better than any of mine did, but it still leaves me wanting to see that mountain!  Perhaps if the rocks were a little brighter (but then the sky would be blown)...or if there was 1 main thing to focus on like a leaf or flower....+ 2 for your attemp 7 total.  Good luck.', '2007-02-06 14:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
