(3335864, 461670, 69102, '<td valign="top">dof is shallow, but focus point seems off. appear to be on the nose, but would have been better (imho) if it had been on the eye, of if the dof had been a little less shallow so that the whole face had been in focus. 4</td>', 'dof is shallow, but focus point seems off. appear to be on the nose, but would have been better (imho) if it had been on the eye, of if the dof had been a little less shallow so that the whole face had been in focus. 4', '2007-02-06 17:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335872, 461554, 69102, '<td valign="top">the dof may be very shallow here, but the lack of foreground or background makes it difficult to judge, and therefore means that the use of shallow dof doesn''t seem to add anything to the image. like the lighting. 4.</td>', 'the dof may be very shallow here, but the lack of foreground or background makes it difficult to judge, and therefore means that the use of shallow dof doesn''t seem to add anything to the image. like the lighting. 4.', '2007-02-06 17:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
