(3336322, 461348, 70270, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge.  Excellent use of shallow DOF to focus on your subject.  Nice colors, soft feel.  Very well done.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge.  Excellent use of shallow DOF to focus on your subject.  Nice colors, soft feel.  Very well done.', '2007-02-06 20:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
