(3336330, 459572, 70270, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  I don''t think the DOF is super shallow (more of a bokeh use of shallow DOF), but the contrast between the berries and the toadstools is great.  8</td>', 'I really like this image.  I don''t think the DOF is super shallow (more of a bokeh use of shallow DOF), but the contrast between the berries and the toadstools is great.  8', '2007-02-06 20:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336337, 458882, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  My guess is this one will get a fair number of DNMCs because your subject is focused at infinity, but I think the framing of the out of focus branches in the nearground are a very creative use of a shallow out of focus field.  Great exposure on the moon, and perfect placement of your subject in almost the only part of the image where it would not be obscured by an out of focus branch.  Great job.  9</td>', 'Great shot.  My guess is this one will get a fair number of DNMCs because your subject is focused at infinity, but I think the framing of the out of focus branches in the nearground are a very creative use of a shallow out of focus field.  Great exposure on the moon, and perfect placement of your subject in almost the only part of the image where it would not be obscured by an out of focus branch.  Great job.  9', '2007-02-06 20:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336339, 461062, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy image.  Colors are a little pale, but overall the image works very well, and great use of shallow DOF to meet the challenge. 8</td>', 'Nice dreamy image.  Colors are a little pale, but overall the image works very well, and great use of shallow DOF to meet the challenge. 8', '2007-02-06 20:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336404, 459509, 7743, '<td valign="top">A little grainy and soft but good use of DOF.  Maybe just needed a slightly faster shutter speed.</td>', 'A little grainy and soft but good use of DOF.  Maybe just needed a slightly faster shutter speed.', '2007-02-06 20:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336413, 459340, 7743, '<td valign="top">The DOF chosen works well with this image however I feel the angle of the shot is letting it down.  Slightly more straight on the cover of the magazine I think would work better.</td>', 'The DOF chosen works well with this image however I feel the angle of the shot is letting it down.  Slightly more straight on the cover of the magazine I think would work better.', '2007-02-06 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336426, 458429, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good idea however I think the DOF chosen is too shallow.  Shooting on more of an angle and using a slightly deeper DOF I think would make the image more dynamic.</td>', 'Good idea however I think the DOF chosen is too shallow.  Shooting on more of an angle and using a slightly deeper DOF I think would make the image more dynamic.', '2007-02-06 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336433, 457950, 7743, '<td valign="top">Though the bird is nicely isolated I feel that the focus is a bit soft and the placement is too far to the left.  A little deeper DOF and a bit more space in front of the bird I think would improve the image.  Also, including the feet.</td>', 'Though the bird is nicely isolated I feel that the focus is a bit soft and the placement is too far to the left.  A little deeper DOF and a bit more space in front of the bird I think would improve the image.  Also, including the feet.', '2007-02-06 20:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336440, 459856, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  I think just slightly more DOF would allow you to get the leaf in sharper focus and create an image with more punch.</td>', 'Nice colours.  I think just slightly more DOF would allow you to get the leaf in sharper focus and create an image with more punch.', '2007-02-06 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
