(3336447, 460566, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good idea though I think a little more DOF would allow the front bible to be entirely in focus and would add more punch to the image.</td>', 'Good idea though I think a little more DOF would allow the front bible to be entirely in focus and would add more punch to the image.', '2007-02-06 20:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336464, 461412, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the idea though I think the person takes up too much room in the frame.  I think a wider angle shot would have more impact.</td>', 'I like the idea though I think the person takes up too much room in the frame.  I think a wider angle shot would have more impact.', '2007-02-06 20:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336466, 461117, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice kitty portrait.  The eyes are very sharp and dray the viewer''s attention instantly.</td>', 'Nice kitty portrait.  The eyes are very sharp and dray the viewer''s attention instantly.', '2007-02-06 20:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336478, 459313, 7743, '<td valign="top">Even though the stem of the apple is very sharp, orange, being a stronger colour, draws the eye away.  Also, with slightly more DOF would give more definition to the background and more context to the image.</td>', 'Even though the stem of the apple is very sharp, orange, being a stronger colour, draws the eye away.  Also, with slightly more DOF would give more definition to the background and more context to the image.', '2007-02-06 20:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336489, 461355, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and perfect choice of DOF.  There''s just enough definition in the background to give context to the image.  The water (glycerin) drops don''t hurt either.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and perfect choice of DOF.  There''s just enough definition in the background to give context to the image.  The water (glycerin) drops don''t hurt either.', '2007-02-06 20:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
