(3337632, 461655, 3214, '<td valign="top">This was quite under-rated, in my opinion.  Not that you need help with your average or anything.  I really like the white balance/lighting here as well as the composition.</td>', 'This was quite under-rated, in my opinion.  Not that you need help with your average or anything.  I really like the white balance/lighting here as well as the composition.', '2007-02-07 01:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3337643, 461586, 70270, '<td valign="top">Since you asked for comments ... I gave you a 4.  Here''s why.  Finnegan''s facial expression is good, but its hard to see the eyes, and that''s what really grabs you in a great pet shot.  We get a little of the left eye (and what we see is good), but nothing on the right.  The light is also a bit harsh on the left, and you''ve lost the detail in the area above his eye.  The background is distracting, even though blurred, because of the lines of color and form that distract from the subject. A more monotone background would have worked better.  The image also could have been cropped much closer to his head, to minimize the distraction of the background.  Finally, the leash going out of the frame on the lower right is distracting.  Some of these are little nits, but they add up, and its the details that really matter.</td>', 'Since you asked for comments ... I gave you a 4.  Here''s why.  Finnegan''s facial expression is good, but its hard to see the eyes, and that''s what really grabs you in a great pet shot.  We get a little of the left eye (and what we see is good), but nothing on the right.  The light is also a bit harsh on the left, and you''ve lost the detail in the area above his eye.  The background is distracting, even though blurred, because of the lines of color and form that distract from the subject. A more monotone background would have worked better.  The image also could have been cropped much closer to his head, to minimize the distraction of the background.  Finally, the leash going out of the frame on the lower right is distracting.  Some of these are little nits, but they add up, and its the details that really matter.', '2007-02-07 01:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3337644, 459794, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, and a good finish....</td>', 'Nice photo, and a good finish....', '2007-02-07 01:12:33.000000', NULL, 0),
