(3337790, 461488, 7743, '<td valign="top">Yes, the DOF is shallow.  You got it.  However, the in focus rocks blend with the background.  The idea with shallow DOF is to use it to isolate the main subject.  With the colours being very similar the rocks aren''t really isolated from the background.</td>', 'Yes, the DOF is shallow.  You got it.  However, the in focus rocks blend with the background.  The idea with shallow DOF is to use it to isolate the main subject.  With the colours being very similar the rocks aren''t really isolated from the background.', '2007-02-07 02:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
