(3338266, 461127, 67152, '<td valign="top">Here are a few thoughts about your image (by the way I gave it a 5 during the challenge - Not a bad image at all, just not a great image that says wow or tells me a story). <br/> <br/>First of all, the image is rather static - the main subject is in the center of the image.  <br/> <br/>Second, the lighting is not very dramatic - the background is dark and the marbles seem to get lost in it.  I would imagine this would have worked much better to show the colors on the marbles (mostly dark blues and reds, etc) on a bright background with bright lighting.  <br/> <br/>I do think you did a nice job of conveying shallow DOF - the focus on the marble in front is pretty good, but the darkness makes it hard to tell on quick glance <br/></td>', 'Here are a few thoughts about your image (by the way I gave it a 5 during the challenge - Not a bad image at all, just not a great image that says wow or tells me a story).  First of all, the image is rather static - the main subject is in the center of the image.   Second, the lighting is not very dramatic - the background is dark and the marbles seem to get lost in it.  I would imagine this would have worked much better to show the colors on the marbles (mostly dark blues and reds, etc) on a bright background with bright lighting.   I do think you did a nice job of conveying shallow DOF - the focus on the marble in front is pretty good, but the darkness makes it hard to tell on quick glance ', '2007-02-07 06:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
