(3339022, 461649, 68797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by legalbeagle:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice!<br/> <br/>Reminds me a little of Jill Greenberg''s <a href="//www.paulkopeikingallery.com/artists/greenberg/exhibitions/endtimes/index.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">series</a>. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ohno!! I felt so bad for all those kiddies...just made me want to cuddle and comfort them all! poor babies..<br/> <br/>about the photo, love it! well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Originally posted by legalbeagle: Very nice! Reminds me a little of Jill Greenberg''s series.   Ohno!! I felt so bad for all those kiddies...just made me want to cuddle and comfort them all! poor babies.. about the photo, love it! well deserved ribbon!', '2007-02-07 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
