(3340735, 461488, 66952, '<td valign="top">I read your post in the forums. I think this is a nice photo that is a good example of shallow DOF. I think a lot of shots in this challenge that actually had shallow <i>but not razor thin</i> DOF got beat up by the voters. So don''t worry about it, you did a good job here.</td>', 'I read your post in the forums. I think this is a nice photo that is a good example of shallow DOF. I think a lot of shots in this challenge that actually had shallow but not razor thin DOF got beat up by the voters. So don''t worry about it, you did a good job here.', '2007-02-07 17:25:30.000000', NULL, 0),
