(3362735, 458831, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Wow looks like you are off to a good start, this being your first challenge you did a great job.  <br/> <br/>"Peacock Strands" is a good entry into Shallow DOF III because it is something different, not the traditional flowers (which I am guilty of using).  This image really does draw the viewer in because the colors are so vibrant.  The colors look very true to what they actually are.  I think voters may have had a harder time voting on this shot because the DOF is kind of hard to tell since it looks more like a repeating pattern.  The focus and lighting look good and well composed. <br/> <br/>Overall I think this was a great first entry and I can see your second did very well, so I really look forward to your future entries.  <br/></td>', '*Critique Club* Wow looks like you are off to a good start, this being your first challenge you did a great job.   "Peacock Strands" is a good entry into Shallow DOF III because it is something different, not the traditional flowers (which I am guilty of using).  This image really does draw the viewer in because the colors are so vibrant.  The colors look very true to what they actually are.  I think voters may have had a harder time voting on this shot because the DOF is kind of hard to tell since it looks more like a repeating pattern.  The focus and lighting look good and well composed.  Overall I think this was a great first entry and I can see your second did very well, so I really look forward to your future entries.  ', '2007-02-13 22:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3362805, 460519, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Wow looks like you are off to a good start, this being your first challenge you did a great job.  <br/> <br/>"Morning" is a good entry into Shallow DOF III because it is something different I am not a coffee or tea drinking so I would not thing of something like this.  Interesting choice to go with black and white.  I am guessing the colors would have been distracting and you choose to keep the image simple, which I think works well.   I like the angle you are shooting at, we are not directly above or that straight on table shot.  Just based on the comments you received it seems like the general voter population would have liked the whole cup in focus.  I think it really is a challenge to determine which part stays in focus and ultimately it is up to us taking the photo.  <br/> <br/>Overall very nice work, especially for a first try! I really look forward to more of your photos. <br/></td>', '*Critique Club* Wow looks like you are off to a good start, this being your first challenge you did a great job.   "Morning" is a good entry into Shallow DOF III because it is something different I am not a coffee or tea drinking so I would not thing of something like this.  Interesting choice to go with black and white.  I am guessing the colors would have been distracting and you choose to keep the image simple, which I think works well.   I like the angle you are shooting at, we are not directly above or that straight on table shot.  Just based on the comments you received it seems like the general voter population would have liked the whole cup in focus.  I think it really is a challenge to determine which part stays in focus and ultimately it is up to us taking the photo.   Overall very nice work, especially for a first try! I really look forward to more of your photos. ', '2007-02-13 22:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
