(3426610, 458116, 48228, '<td valign="top">I like this one, and love how you have taken it. <br/>Great detail of the flower, against the black background.</td>', 'I like this one, and love how you have taken it. Great detail of the flower, against the black background.', '2007-03-03 21:39:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3433472, 459876, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, Stefan, this is my kind of art.  Love you great ''seeing'' in capturing this flower.</td>', 'Oh, Stefan, this is my kind of art.  Love you great ''seeing'' in capturing this flower.', '2007-03-06 10:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3437110, 461544, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to capture insects in flight before, and know how difficult it is- I gave this a very high score. You not only managed to capture the bee in sharp detail, but include beautiful bokeh and compose it well. Very well done indeed!</td>', 'I''ve tried to capture insects in flight before, and know how difficult it is- I gave this a very high score. You not only managed to capture the bee in sharp detail, but include beautiful bokeh and compose it well. Very well done indeed!', '2007-03-07 09:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3454636, 460436, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF, composition and also the softness of this one......</td>', 'I really like the DOF, composition and also the softness of this one......', '2007-03-12 20:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3456680, 458443, 59029, '<td valign="top">Jennifer, I''m a stickler for horse shots, and I think you did a lovely job capturing the texture of the horse''s coat, the whorls on the face etc.  Very good shot, you will only get better!</td>', 'Jennifer, I''m a stickler for horse shots, and I think you did a lovely job capturing the texture of the horse''s coat, the whorls on the face etc.  Very good shot, you will only get better!', '2007-03-13 14:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459215, 458098, 67883, '<td valign="top">Þessi er alveg geðveikt sniðug...mjöf vel gert ;)</td>', 'Þessi er alveg geðveikt sniðug...mjöf vel gert ;)', '2007-03-14 07:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3468730, 459794, 63269, '<td valign="top">Usually, I can''t stand flower pictures. I''ve seen too many of them!<br/>But this. This is just beautiful! Stunning! I absolutly love the blaze of colors, and the shallow DOF just makes this photo. Completely different from the typical flower shot. I love this photo! GREAT job! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-20 09:52:38.</i></td>', 'Usually, I can''t stand flower pictures. I''ve seen too many of them!But this. This is just beautiful! Stunning! I absolutly love the blaze of colors, and the shallow DOF just makes this photo. Completely different from the typical flower shot. I love this photo! GREAT job! :)', '2007-03-17 16:23:50.000000', '2007-03-20 09:52:38.000000', 0),
(3493458, 461565, 3569, '<td valign="top">If you are interested, you can find out who, where, why, when, the bird was banded/collar marked by entering the data here.  They will send you back information on the bird.<br/> <br/>Van<br/> <br/><a href="//www.pwrc.usgs.gov/bbl/homepage/recwobnd.cfm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bird Banding Office</a></td>', 'If you are interested, you can find out who, where, why, when, the bird was banded/collar marked by entering the data here.  They will send you back information on the bird. Van Bird Banding Office', '2007-03-28 09:05:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3496126, 459313, 70689, '<td valign="top">I Agree with both comments. If both apples were entirely within the DOF, the oranges would still be soft enough and the picture would be much better. Nevertheless I still like the picture for it''s bright colours and composition. I might do a remake some day.</td>', 'I Agree with both comments. If both apples were entirely within the DOF, the oranges would still be soft enough and the picture would be much better. Nevertheless I still like the picture for it''s bright colours and composition. I might do a remake some day.', '2007-03-29 04:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3498498, 458143, 32997, '<td valign="top">strange fetish...</td>', 'strange fetish...', '2007-03-29 23:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3499150, 460527, 53213, '<td valign="top">I like it. I like it a lot.</td>', 'I like it. I like it a lot.', '2007-03-30 08:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3501466, 461201, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this one didn''t do a bit better in the scoring.  I really like the colors and composition and the focus seems right on.  The darkness in the background is perhaps a bit distracting, but overall I like this one very much.</td>', 'I''m surprised this one didn''t do a bit better in the scoring.  I really like the colors and composition and the focus seems right on.  The darkness in the background is perhaps a bit distracting, but overall I like this one very much.', '2007-03-31 02:42:10.000000', NULL, 0);
