(4199823, 461326, 74559, '<td valign="top">I''ve been sitting here staring at this for five minutes... fabulous image! The tones are unexpected, gorgeous; the layers upon layers of plant life, amazing; the bird posing perfectly in the center of the light, perfection...I love this LOTS!</td>', 'I''ve been sitting here staring at this for five minutes... fabulous image! The tones are unexpected, gorgeous; the layers upon layers of plant life, amazing; the bird posing perfectly in the center of the light, perfection...I love this LOTS!', '2007-10-27 18:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4256335, 461655, 66635, '<td valign="top">Sexy.  I can feel those fishnets.</td>', 'Sexy.  I can feel those fishnets.', '2007-11-18 21:52:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4330510, 459313, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think that, instead of stopping down to get the front apple in focus, I''d suggest dropping it out of the picture.  Go for as many contrasts as possible: apple/orange, green/orange, near/far, sharp/blurred, AND one/many.  If you decide to retry it, I suggest also moving to a lower angle so the close apple towers over the distant oranges.  Also, try spraying some water on the apple (can''t tell you why, but it usually adds interest), and make the apple brighter than the oranges.</td>', 'I think that, instead of stopping down to get the front apple in focus, I''d suggest dropping it out of the picture.  Go for as many contrasts as possible: apple/orange, green/orange, near/far, sharp/blurred, AND one/many.  If you decide to retry it, I suggest also moving to a lower angle so the close apple towers over the distant oranges.  Also, try spraying some water on the apple (can''t tell you why, but it usually adds interest), and make the apple brighter than the oranges.', '2007-12-22 21:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4424949, 459794, 4162, '<td valign="top">Stunning..this really caught my eye..beautiful!</td>', 'Stunning..this really caught my eye..beautiful!', '2008-01-25 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4425223, 459794, 77393, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.', '2008-01-25 20:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4471556, 459467, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  Colors are beautiful - I see you <i>dropped</i> the saturation - bet you were amazed you had to do that.  From what I recall, I think the shallow dof wasn''t ''working'' as much I envisioned in this Challenge (hence the score).</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  Colors are beautiful - I see you dropped the saturation - bet you were amazed you had to do that.  From what I recall, I think the shallow dof wasn''t ''working'' as much I envisioned in this Challenge (hence the score).', '2008-02-08 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
