(5530188, 461391, 66384, '<td valign="top">I know this is an old photo, but it the first time I''ve seen it. I really like the geometric composition with the blocks of subtle color and the circle anchoring the corner. What drew me to this image, was the frowning face on the tennis ball. I think this is the way the loser must have felt about the final point that landed right on the edge of the court. :)</td>', 'I know this is an old photo, but it the first time I''ve seen it. I really like the geometric composition with the blocks of subtle color and the circle anchoring the corner. What drew me to this image, was the frowning face on the tennis ball. I think this is the way the loser must have felt about the final point that landed right on the edge of the court. :)', '2009-06-15 20:11:03.000000', NULL, 0),
