(6100311, 461586, 48820, '<td valign="top">OMG!  Finnegan looks like our dog Chaun.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=861198" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48820/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_861198.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48820/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_861198.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48820/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_861198.jpg"/></a>Chaun is a mix Wolfhound/Lab and weighs about 120 pounds.<br/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=884377" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48820/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_884377.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48820/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_884377.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48820/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_884377.jpg"/></a> <br/>We rescued him from Indian Creek Sanctuary in Michigan.</td>', 'OMG!  Finnegan looks like our dog Chaun.Chaun is a mix Wolfhound/Lab and weighs about 120 pounds.  We rescued him from Indian Creek Sanctuary in Michigan.', '2010-07-21 22:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
